SF-202 — a 17-file conformance suite that no scope ever executes
================================================================

Target:   skills/spec-double-2/scripts/tla_spec_dev.py (`run spec-unit-tests --scope`)
Unit:     tla-spec-dev
Proposed by: SI-05 (issue #338). NOT applied here: tla_spec_dev.py is outside
          SI-05's conflict keys.

Re-measured on the epic tip (994f650c):

  * `--scope` choices are still exactly {auto, project};
  * `specs/desired_program_model/tests/` still holds 17 files;
  * no scope value resolves to that directory, so none of them has ever run.

This is the "an oracle that is never pointed at a surface reports nothing about
it, which is not the same as reporting that it is clean" shape.

